Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.28,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Hari ke-4 sudah tiba —\N{\c&H00FFFF&}Day 4 is here —

Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.28,0:00:05.06,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}kita masuk ke ML dan neural network.\N{\c&H00FFFF&}diving into ML and neural networks.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.06,0:00:06.40,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Dalam 50 tahun terakhir,\N{\c&H00FFFF&}In the last 50 years,

Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:09.70,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}ilmuwan menemukan ratusan faktor\N{\c&H00FFFF&}scientists discovered hundreds of factors

Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:11.58,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}yang mempengaruhi pasar saham.\N{\c&H00FFFF&}that affect the stock market.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:14.34,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Namun, 65% dari faktor itu\N{\c&H00FFFF&}However, 65% of those factors

Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.38,0:00:16.34,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}hanyalah noise yang tak bisa direplikasi.\N{\c&H00FFFF&}are just noise — can't be replicated.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:19.56,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Seperti ditunjukkan paper 2020 ini.\N{\c&H00FFFF&}As shown by this 2020 research paper.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:21.50,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Daripada menebak tiap faktor,\N{\c&H00FFFF&}So instead of guessing each factor,

Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:23.38,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}ilmuwan pakai neural network —\N{\c&H00FFFF&}scientists used a neural network —

Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.74,0:00:25.94,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}sistem yang meniru otak manusia,\N{\c&H00FFFF&}a system replicating the human brain,

Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.02,0:00:28.04,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}menggunakan lapisan node, atau neuron.\N{\c&H00FFFF&}using layers of nodes, or neurons.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:29.42,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Mereka menemukan bahwa\N{\c&H00FFFF&}They found that

Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:32.16,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}sistem ini menaikkan Sharpe Ratio\N{\c&H00FFFF&}this system raised the Sharpe Ratio

Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:33.98,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}dan R² hampir dua kali lipat!\N{\c&H00FFFF&}and R² by almost double!

Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.98,0:00:34.78,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Mereka pun mencoba\N{\c&H00FFFF&}They also tried

Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:35.96,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}sistem reinforcement learning —\N{\c&H00FFFF&}reinforcement learning —

Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:38.34,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}memberi reward kalau cuan,\N{\c&H00FFFF&}rewards agents for profit,

Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:40.54,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}menghukum kalau rugi.\N{\c&H00FFFF&}penalizes them for losses.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:42.78,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Dengan sistem ini, agen belajar\N{\c&H00FFFF&}With this system, agents learn

Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:45.72,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}pola-pola agar cuan sesering mungkin.\N{\c&H00FFFF&}patterns to profit as often as possible.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:47.52,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Sistem ini mencapai\N{\c&H00FFFF&}This system secured

Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:51.54,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Sharpe 2.0  ·  alpha 13% out-of-sample.\N{\c&H00FFFF&}Sharpe 2.0  ·  out-of-sample alpha 13%.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:53.58,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Kita sudah bahas dua sistem —\N{\c&H00FFFF&}We've discussed two systems —

Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:56.92,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}keduanya punya Sharpe dan R² tinggi.\N{\c&H00FFFF&}both show high Sharpe and R².

Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.40,0:00:58.94,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Jadi kenapa tidak semua orang pakai?\N{\c&H00FFFF&}So why doesn't everyone use them?

Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.94,0:01:01.48,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Masalahnya, riset ini masih mentah.\N{\c&H00FFFF&}The problem: results are still raw.

Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:05.08,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Belum ada biaya transaksi & crowding.\N{\c&H00FFFF&}No transaction costs or crowding factored in.

Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.08,0:01:06.16,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Strategi memang penting,\N{\c&H00FFFF&}Strategy is important,

Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:09.14,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}tapi kalau semua pakai strategi yang sama,\N{\c&H00FFFF&}but if everyone uses the same strategy,

Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:10.88,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}hilang sudah edge-mu.\N{\c&H00FFFF&}there goes your edge.

Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:12.56,BL,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Tapi ini semua hanya angka.\N{\c&H00FFFF&}But these are all just numbers.

